# tests/app.script - the app installed, started and updated as a user would (make test-app;
# --mode none: time 0 = the Desktop up, Files open at the card's root):
#  1. PRINCE.HZA found in Files by typing its name, opened: the Installer asks, Install;
#  2. Programs menu (F10, Right), End to "Games >", Enter (its pop-up), Enter: the game;
#  3. its loading screen, its first screen, Space there: level 1 at once (no title); a
#     quicksave (F6: QUICKSAVE.SAV in the app's folder), Ctrl+Q;
#  4. PRINCE.HZA opened again: Replace, which must keep QUICKSAVE.SAV (tests/app.sh).
1000 prince\n
+0 wait install: asks: Install /APPS/PRINCE
+800 shot
+500 \n
+0 wait install: installed /APPS/PRINCE
+800 \n
# (on the board's card, run816's default: the install takes a few seconds, the Desktop then
# reads the new Programs list, and the Programs and Games menus check their programs on the
# card as they open: about 2 s each)
+6000 {f10}
+400 {right}
+3000 {end}
+400 \n
+3000 shot
+400 \n
+0 wait prince: start
+1500 shot
+500 {space}
+0 wait prince: level 1
+0 wait prince: text LEVEL 1
+3000 shot
+300 {f6}
+0 wait prince: text QUICKSAVE
+800 ^Q
+3000 prince\n
+0 wait install: asks: Replace /APPS/PRINCE
+500 \n
+0 wait install: replaced /APPS/PRINCE
+800 \n
